 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_9f52c4024e2f574877781144916cb4da" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_c5dec06a7866a3682aa81051c32d4e60" />
 <bp:entityFeature rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ModificationFeature_a427c0a32dcbd3c596988112554aa296" />
 <bp:standardName rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Aromatic-L-amino-acid decarboxylase</bp:standardName>
 <bp:xref rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/RelationshipXref_hgnc_symbol_DDC_identity" />
 <bp:xref rdf:resource="http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/UnificationXref_uniprot_knowledgebase_P20711" />
 <bp:organism rdf:resource="http://identifiers.org/taxonomy/9606" />
 <bp:displayName rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DDC_HUMAN</bp:displayName>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AADC</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DDC</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">4.1.1.28</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DOPA decarboxylase</bp:name>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://www.ctdbase.org/#ref_protein_gene_1644</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_dip_DIP-40563N_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Catalyzes the decarboxylation of L-3,4-dihydroxyphenylalanine (DOPA) to dopamine, L-5-hydroxytryptophanto serotonin and L-tryptophan to tryptamine.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=H(+) + L-dopa = CO2 + dopamine; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:12272,ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:16526, ChEBI:CHEBI:57504,ChEBI:CHEBI:59905; EC=4.1.1.28;CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=5-hydroxy-L-tryptophan + H(+) = CO2 + serotonin;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:18533, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:16526,ChEBI:CHEBI:58266, ChEBI:CHEBI:350546; EC=4.1.1.28;COFACTOR:Name=pyridoxal 5&apos;-phosphate; Xref=ChEBI:CHEBI:597326;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:22143761};PATHWAY: Catecholamine biosynthesis; dopamine biosynthesis;dopamine from L-tyrosine: step 2/2.SUBUNIT: Homodimer. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:22143761}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=4;Name=1;IsoId=P20711-1; Sequence=Displayed;Name=2; Synonyms=alt-DDC;IsoId=P20711-2; Sequence=VSP_046569, VSP_046570;Note=High expression in kidney.;Name=3;IsoId=P20711-3; Sequence=VSP_047175;Note=No experimental confirmation available. Gene predictionbased on EST data.;Name=4;IsoId=P20711-4; Sequence=VSP_047176;Note=No experimental confirmation available. Gene predictionbased on EST data.;DISEASE: Aromatic L-amino-acid decarboxylase deficiency (AADCD)[MIM:608643]: An inborn error in neurotransmitter metabolism thatleads to combined serotonin and catecholamine deficiency. Itcauses developmental and psychomotor delay, poor feeding,lethargy, ptosis, intermittent hypothermia, gastrointestinaldisturbances. The onset is early in infancy and inheritance isautosomal recessive. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:14991824,ECO:0000269|PubMed:15079002, ECO:0000269|Ref.12}. Note=The diseaseis caused by mutations affecting the gene represented in thisentry.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the group II decarboxylase family.{ECO:0000305}.WEB RESOURCE: Name=NIEHS-SNPs;URL=&quot;http://egp.gs.washington.edu/data/ddc/&quot;;WEB RESOURCE: Name=Wikipedia; Note=Aromatic L-amino-aciddecarboxylase entry;URL=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aromatic-L-amino-acid_decarboxylase&quot;;WEB RESOURCE: Name=Atlas of Genetics and Cytogenetics in Oncologyand Haematology;URL=&quot;http://atlasgeneticsoncology.org/Genes/DDCID50590ch7p12.html&quot;; COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_uniprotkb_P20711_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://mirtarbase.mbc.nctu.edu.tw/#ref_1644</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_HPRD_00145_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DDC_HUMAN Reviewed; 480 AA.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://biocyc.org/biopax/biopax-level3ProteinReference84068</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/uniprot/Q6IBS8</bp:comment>
